          "description": "HEY contacts and the Screener: contact records and notes, bundling, and clearance (screening) decisions.\n\nGateway tool: call with {\"action\": \"...\", \"params\": {...}}.\nCall {\"action\": \"describe\", \"params\": {\"action\": \"NAME\"}} for an action's full parameter schema.\n\nACTIONS (RO = read-only):\n- bulk_update_clearances: Screen several senders out at once\n- bundle_contact: Bundle a contact so their mail arrives grouped\n- create_contact: Add a contact\n- delete_contact_note: Clear the private note on a contact\n- get_clearances (RO, paginated): Get the Screener — the pending count, and the senders waiting when asked for them\n- get_contact (RO, paginated): Get a contact, with a page of the threads they are on\n- get_contact_note (RO): Read the private note kept on a contact\n- get_my_clearances (RO, paginated): The senders already screened in or out\n- hide_contact: Hide a contact\n- list_contacts (RO, paginated): List contacts\n- punt_clearances: Clear the Screener — every pending sender is punted and reexamined on their next email\n- reveal_contact: Put a hidden contact back in the contact list\n- unbundle_contact: Stop bundling a contact's mail\n- update_clearance: Screen a sender in or out of the Screener\n- update_contact: Edit a contact\n- update_contact_clearance: Screen a contact in or out\n- update_contact_note: Write the private note on a contact, replacing whatever was there\n- update_my_clearance: Rescreen a sender who was already screened in or out\n",
